WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.040 --> 00:00:05.040
Everyone knows that bounties are the most
common way to quickly judge a pirate’s strength

00:00:05.040 --> 00:00:06.040
in one piece.

00:00:06.040 --> 00:00:11.360
And right now, Luffy’s bounty is at an impressive
3 billion berries, BUT WE ALL KNOW that the

00:00:11.360 --> 00:00:17.020
World Government is massively undervaluing
his true threat level, because he is the only

00:00:17.020 --> 00:00:21.689
person alive capable of burning down their
entire organization.

00:00:21.689 --> 00:00:27.630
So what if the government had been actually
smart and instead of these measly 3 billion

00:00:27.630 --> 00:00:34.219
berries, had decided to give him a bounty
so stupidly massive that EVERY SINGLE Marine,

00:00:34.219 --> 00:00:39.120
Bounty-hunter and PIRATE in the world would
have no other choice but come for Luffy’s

00:00:39.120 --> 00:00:40.120
head?

00:00:40.120 --> 00:00:45.969
What if Luffy had the unimaginable bounty
of 100 Billion Berries?

00:00:45.969 --> 00:00:50.969
And this adventure begins with Luffy already
making serious waves in the Grand Line.

00:00:50.969 --> 00:00:55.059
After he defeated the warlord Crocodile in
Alabasta, the world government issued him

00:00:55.059 --> 00:01:02.610
a 100 million berry bounty And this was a
game changer because it was the very first

00:01:02.610 --> 00:01:05.620
time that Luffy had truly ruffled the government’s
feathers.

00:01:05.620 --> 00:01:10.259
You see, the world government had to cover
up that one of their own government backed

00:01:10.259 --> 00:01:13.830
warlords basically caused a giant civil war.

00:01:13.830 --> 00:01:19.200
So at this point Luffy has the government’s
attention, which is why he reached his first

00:01:19.200 --> 00:01:20.600
nine digit bounty.

00:01:20.600 --> 00:01:26.329
However, this dumpster fire of problems only
burns brighter after the chaos of Enies Lobby,

00:01:26.329 --> 00:01:32.450
where Luffy not only declared war on the world
government, but also defeated this group of

00:01:32.450 --> 00:01:41.790
secret agents and basically trashed the Judiciary
island.

00:01:41.790 --> 00:01:45.550
And now this is where our version of the story
is going to change.

00:01:45.550 --> 00:01:52.549
I mean, the world government originally only
moved Luffy up to 300 million, but I mean

00:01:52.549 --> 00:01:53.549
seriously?

00:01:53.549 --> 00:01:54.549
That’s it?

00:01:54.549 --> 00:02:00.649
This man just basically came into your home,
beat you down AND stole your girl and that’s

00:02:00.649 --> 00:02:03.159
ALL that you are going to do to him?

00:02:03.159 --> 00:02:04.829
Surely, not?

00:02:04.829 --> 00:02:10.770
Plus Luffy was ever so close to finding out
what is really down in this massive hole beneath

00:02:10.770 --> 00:02:17.569
Enies Lobby, so let’s imagine the government
has had enough of Luffy and decided to slap

00:02:17.569 --> 00:02:19.980
TRULY MASSIVE 5.

00:02:19.980 --> 00:02:20.980
BILLION.

00:02:20.980 --> 00:02:22.090
BERRY bounty on his head.

00:02:22.090 --> 00:02:34.440
Which is 

00:02:34.440 --> 00:02:40.530
a truly historic number which is going to
completely change the Straw Hats journey after

00:02:40.530 --> 00:02:42.420
the escape from Enies Lobby.

00:02:42.420 --> 00:02:49.069
That’s because we have only ever seen two
bounties cross the 5 billion berry mark – those

00:02:49.069 --> 00:02:56.409
being Roger and Whitebeard – but those two
were so insanely overpowered that they were

00:02:56.409 --> 00:02:59.260
basically untouchable.

00:02:59.260 --> 00:03:02.480
No random pirate was coming after their heads.

00:03:02.480 --> 00:03:05.640
But Luffy is not even close to their level.

00:03:05.640 --> 00:03:16.489
At this point he doesn’t even know haki,
so he’s essentially a sitting duck, waiting

00:03:16.489 --> 00:03:19.510
to be taken to the world government for a
nice holiday meal.

00:03:19.510 --> 00:03:24.330
I mean, even Nami might seriously consider
betraying Luffy for that stupid amount of

00:03:24.330 --> 00:03:28.460
money.

00:03:28.460 --> 00:03:34.080
Because of this insane new bounty, their journey
from Post-Enies Lobby to Sabaody is going

00:03:34.080 --> 00:03:37.129
to be way more chaotic.

00:03:37.129 --> 00:03:43.510
That’s because they will be chased by every
pirate, marine, and bounty hunter who knows

00:03:43.510 --> 00:03:45.280
that they are in the area.

00:03:45.280 --> 00:03:52.370
Perhaps they would even encounter this emperor
of the underworld, Peclo, who might be tempted

00:03:52.370 --> 00:03:57.120
to show his creepy clown mask to come after
the straw hats.

00:03:57.120 --> 00:04:03.840
But with the straw hats' new ship and their
genius navigator, I still think the straw

00:04:03.840 --> 00:04:09.439
hats will make it through and eventually end
up on Thriller Bark just like in the original

00:04:09.439 --> 00:04:10.750
story.

00:04:10.750 --> 00:04:19.010
Who knows, the straw hats may even think this
zombie filled island is a vacation after being

00:04:19.010 --> 00:04:23.950
chased non-stop.

00:04:23.950 --> 00:04:29.669
But I don’t think much will change here,
so the straw hats defeat this shadowy onion

00:04:29.669 --> 00:04:33.860
man and head off to Sabaody.

00:04:33.860 --> 00:04:39.740
However, they are instantly met with dozens
of greedy pirates waiting for the straw hats

00:04:39.740 --> 00:04:40.740
once they leave.

00:04:40.740 --> 00:04:45.289
Which means that they don’t get any time
to rest or recover, which is especially bad

00:04:45.289 --> 00:04:51.480
for Zoro who is basically on the brink of
death.

00:04:51.480 --> 00:04:57.229
So because of this, it is possible that the
straw hats don’t even make it to Sabaody,

00:04:57.229 --> 00:05:04.060
especially if a strong pirate crew came after
Luffy’s bounty.

00:05:04.060 --> 00:05:11.220
But we can’t end the story here, so one
option is they just keep tons of cola on the

00:05:11.220 --> 00:05:14.150
ship so they can fly away whenever they are
in danger.

00:05:14.150 --> 00:05:19.120
Or another very logical possibility is that
the Dark King, Rayleigh, would actually come

00:05:19.120 --> 00:05:24.139
out to meet the straw hats and guide them
to the island.

00:05:24.139 --> 00:05:30.270
Certainly, the former pirate king’s right
hand man would be strong enough to get them

00:05:30.270 --> 00:05:37.199
through because he is still a top-tier fighter
who can even frighten Yonkos and Admirals.

00:05:37.199 --> 00:05:41.960
Now before we go any further, you might be
asking why would Rayleigh go to so much trouble

00:05:41.960 --> 00:05:43.060
to help the straw hats?

00:05:43.060 --> 00:05:48.819
Well, in chapter 506 we learned that Rayleigh
had actually spoken with Shanks about Luffy

00:05:48.819 --> 00:05:50.110
sometime in the past.

00:05:50.110 --> 00:05:54.259
And while this is never confirmed, I’ve
always thought there might have been a plan

00:05:54.259 --> 00:05:59.199
for the former Roger pirates to help Luffy
when he eventually started his journey to

00:05:59.199 --> 00:06:00.449
be pirate king.

00:06:00.449 --> 00:06:06.520
So if Rayleigh saw such a massive bounty for
Luffy, I definitely think he would recognize

00:06:06.520 --> 00:06:12.010
the danger Luffy would be in and do all that
he could to make sure Luffy’s journey wasn’t

00:06:12.010 --> 00:06:14.979
cut short.

00:06:14.979 --> 00:06:20.169
But how long will Rayleigh’s strength keep
them safe?

00:06:20.169 --> 00:06:22.030
Keep watching to find out.

00:06:22.030 --> 00:06:27.720
Despite how much we want more of him in the
story, Rayleigh cannot babysit them forever,

00:06:27.720 --> 00:06:33.900
because he will eventually need to coat the
Straw Hat’s ship so they can go underwater.

00:06:33.900 --> 00:06:38.110
But before they separate, Rayleigh makes a
vivre card for Luffy, so that he can keep

00:06:38.110 --> 00:06:39.979
track of the straw hat captain.

00:06:39.979 --> 00:06:45.690
But during this time, I still think Luffy
would find his way into trouble.

00:06:45.690 --> 00:06:50.009
Maybe he randomly comes across a world nobel
just like Zoro did.

00:06:50.009 --> 00:06:54.490
Or he is being chased by pirates trying to
capture him and he punches a world noble who

00:06:54.490 --> 00:06:55.850
gets in his way.

00:06:55.850 --> 00:07:03.240
Either way, it is basically guaranteed that
Luffy would find some way to attack the despicable

00:07:03.240 --> 00:07:04.240
world nobles.

00:07:04.240 --> 00:07:08.300
And the rest of Sabaody would play out basically
the same.

00:07:08.300 --> 00:07:14.030
The marine admiral Kizaru and the cyborg Pacifistas
still come and attack the island, meaning

00:07:14.030 --> 00:07:20.130
the straw hats stand no chance of survival
until they are sent flying all across the

00:07:20.130 --> 00:07:21.430
world by this guy.

00:07:21.430 --> 00:07:27.760
So, at this pivotal moment the straw hat journey
has been mostly the same,&nbsp; except Luffy’s

00:07:27.760 --> 00:07:31.539
bounty has sky-rocketed to a jaw-dropping
5 billion berries.

00:07:31.539 --> 00:07:36.180
Which means they were chased every single
step of the way after leaving Enies Lobby.

00:07:36.180 --> 00:07:41.509
But so far they’ve survived with a little
luck and powerful friends.

00:07:41.509 --> 00:07:44.160
However, all that is about to change.

00:07:44.160 --> 00:07:49.970
Now, we know it took about a day or two day
for Luffy to fly all the way to Amazon Lily,

00:07:49.970 --> 00:07:56.069
so in this time the world government will
surely react to the events on Sabaody.

00:07:56.069 --> 00:08:03.479
Not only did Luffy commit the single worst
crime by attacking a world noble, he also

00:08:03.479 --> 00:08:05.699
escaped capture AGAIN.

00:08:05.699 --> 00:08:10.960
So combine all these things with the World
Government’s fears about the true nature

00:08:10.960 --> 00:08:16.879
of Luffy’s devil fruit, and I definitely
think at this point they would take absolutely

00:08:16.879 --> 00:08:22.280
no chances and slap him with this mind-boggling
bounty.

00:08:22.280 --> 00:08:24.500
That’s ONE.

00:08:24.500 --> 00:08:25.620
HUNDRED.

00:08:25.620 --> 00:08:26.729
Billion.

00:08:26.729 --> 00:08:28.610
Billion… with a B.

00:08:28.610 --> 00:08:34.650
And to understand just how insane this bounty
is, let’s break down what this number actually

00:08:34.650 --> 00:08:35.650
means.

00:08:35.650 --> 00:08:39.300
So let’s say you’ve somehow captured Luffy
and turned him into the world government.

00:08:39.300 --> 00:08:44.660
And you’ve just been delivered this massive
stack of cash and treasure.

00:08:44.660 --> 00:08:52.570
Well, in the one piece world what would you
be able to buy with all this money?

00:08:52.570 --> 00:09:00.540
We know that a new ship costs a minimum of
300 million berries, so with 100 billion you

00:09:00.540 --> 00:09:07.740
could buy 333 top class ships to basically
have your own world conquering navy.

00:09:07.740 --> 00:09:13.940
But that’s not even the craziest comparison
because from chapter 766 we know that the

00:09:13.940 --> 00:09:19.779
world government was willing to pay 5 billion
berries for the Ope Ope no mi, which some

00:09:19.779 --> 00:09:24.959
consider to be the most valuable devil fruit
in the world because it allows the user to

00:09:24.959 --> 00:09:27.390
perform the immortality surgery.

00:09:27.390 --> 00:09:34.700
So with 100 billion berries you could probably
buy at least 20 super overpowered devil fruits

00:09:34.700 --> 00:09:36.920
from anyone willing to sell them.

00:09:36.920 --> 00:09:43.020
But if devil fruits aren’t your style, you
could even become king of your own empire,

00:09:43.020 --> 00:09:48.620
because we know that Doflamingo once stated
that he would sell the kingdom of Dressrosa

00:09:48.620 --> 00:09:51.110
for a staggering 10 billion berries.

00:09:51.110 --> 00:09:59.490
So with your fat stack of cash, you can buy
your own set of kingdoms.

00:09:59.490 --> 00:10:03.760
Now that’s all good and well in the One
Piece world, but you might be thinking, Manu

00:10:03.760 --> 00:10:06.060
what could I actually buy in the real world?

00:10:06.060 --> 00:10:11.180
Well, to put this into context, berries are
usually assumed to be equal to the Japanese

00:10:11.180 --> 00:10:12.180
yen.

00:10:12.180 --> 00:10:15.130
So that means this would be 100 billion yen.

00:10:15.130 --> 00:10:18.399
That’s about the same as all of these.

00:10:18.399 --> 00:10:22.519
So what could you buy with all of this money?

00:10:22.519 --> 00:10:29.450
This much would get you 700 million bags of
MnM’s, two million Nintendo switch consoles,

00:10:29.450 --> 00:10:35.540
or even let you buy the world’s most expensive
luxury airplane plus your own private island.

00:10:35.540 --> 00:10:38.670
Alright, who’s lining up to capture Luffy?

00:10:38.670 --> 00:10:40.060
Anyone want to team up?

00:10:40.060 --> 00:10:46.899
However, chasing after Luffy now might actually
not be the smartest idea if you are a weak

00:10:46.899 --> 00:10:47.899
pirate.

00:10:47.899 --> 00:10:52.690
And that’s because with such an insanely
high bounty, Luffy is undoubtedly now the

00:10:52.690 --> 00:10:56.279
most famous pirate in the world.

00:10:56.279 --> 00:11:00.860
And with this instant fame and a huge reward
for his head, he is going to attract the attention

00:11:00.860 --> 00:11:05.399
of some of the most dangerous people in the
world, who will certainly by making their

00:11:05.399 --> 00:11:07.670
own appearances later on in this video.

00:11:07.670 --> 00:11:13.970
But now Luffy crashlands on the island of
women and is nearly killed by these deadly

00:11:13.970 --> 00:11:14.970
mushrooms.

00:11:14.970 --> 00:11:19.700
And at this point, the women wouldn’t know
who Luffy is because they don’t have any

00:11:19.700 --> 00:11:21.810
real contact with the outside world.

00:11:21.810 --> 00:11:27.220
However, that all changes when the pirate
empress herself arrives on the island.

00:11:27.220 --> 00:11:32.870
And once Hancock recognizes that the most
wanted man in the world has shown up on her

00:11:32.870 --> 00:11:37.029
island, I definitely think she would try to
capture him and tell the World Government

00:11:37.029 --> 00:11:39.330
to come pick him up.

00:11:39.330 --> 00:11:41.790
And why would she do that?

00:11:41.790 --> 00:11:46.610
Well, maybe she thinks she can trade him to
true independence for her island.

00:11:46.610 --> 00:11:50.839
After all that’s why she became a warlord
in the first place so that the World Government

00:11:50.839 --> 00:11:52.560
would leave her island alone.

00:11:52.560 --> 00:11:55.540
Which means Luffy is in serious danger.

00:11:55.540 --> 00:12:03.460
But that all changes once she falls madly
in love with the honorable straw hat captain.

00:12:03.460 --> 00:12:08.529
But how this happens would probably have to
play out differently than in the original

00:12:08.529 --> 00:12:09.529
story.

00:12:09.529 --> 00:12:12.940
Maybe Luffy shows his bravery and kindness
by fighting off pirates coming to ransack

00:12:12.940 --> 00:12:19.310
the island or something else, but for now
let’s just assume that Hancock still falls

00:12:19.310 --> 00:12:20.310
in love with him.

00:12:20.310 --> 00:12:24.870
And the lovestruck pirate empress immediately
realizes just how dangerous this situation

00:12:24.870 --> 00:12:26.040
has become.

00:12:26.040 --> 00:12:30.681
Because somehow the information that Luffy
is on her island has leaked from the World

00:12:30.681 --> 00:12:31.681
Government.

00:12:31.681 --> 00:12:37.240
Which means tons of strong fighters are coming
to claim Luffy’s head.

00:12:37.240 --> 00:12:44.060
At this point, I’m thinking Kizaru would
try to redeem his failure at Sabaody by capturing

00:12:44.060 --> 00:12:45.510
Luffy.

00:12:45.510 --> 00:12:50.290
But we can also include strong fighters from
the Yonko’s crew such as King from the Beast

00:12:50.290 --> 00:12:52.930
Pirates since he can fly over the calm belt.

00:12:52.930 --> 00:12:57.450
And we can even give a job to someone like
Katakuri from Big Mom’s crew, since Oda

00:12:57.450 --> 00:12:59.790
never did it in the manga.

00:12:59.790 --> 00:13:05.240
And both of these Yonko would have reasons
to want the bounty.

00:13:05.240 --> 00:13:11.820
Kaido to pay for his operation making artificial
devil fruits and Big Mom to fund her research

00:13:11.820 --> 00:13:17.630
into making people into giants.

00:13:17.630 --> 00:13:23.820
With all of these incredibly strong fighters
coming to capture Luffy, the island of women

00:13:23.820 --> 00:13:26.209
is in serious danger.

00:13:26.209 --> 00:13:32.019
Luffy certainly isn’t strong enough yet
to fight these top-tier fighters, and while

00:13:32.019 --> 00:13:38.699
Boa might possibly be on the level of Yonko
Commander, she can’t take them all on herself.

00:13:38.699 --> 00:13:43.060
So instead of keeping Luffy on the island,
they sneak him out during the night and let

00:13:43.060 --> 00:13:49.090
everyone know that someone already came and
kidnapped Luffy.

00:13:49.090 --> 00:13:52.150
But this still leaves one massive problem
for Luffy.

00:13:52.150 --> 00:13:59.230
But with the way things are now, the story
absolutely cannot continue as it did originally.

00:13:59.230 --> 00:14:03.040
At this point in the story, Hancock snuck
Luffy into Impel Down so that he could rescue

00:14:03.040 --> 00:14:04.040
Ace.

00:14:04.040 --> 00:14:08.199
And while I think Luffy would still want to
do that, there are some changes here that

00:14:08.199 --> 00:14:10.540
are going to prevent that from happening.

00:14:10.540 --> 00:14:15.829
First, Hancock is already off of her island,
so she would basically have already ignored

00:14:15.829 --> 00:14:18.750
the summons to come to Marineford for the
execution.

00:14:18.750 --> 00:14:23.880
It is extremely unlikely that she could now
just show up to a government ship and demand

00:14:23.880 --> 00:14:25.449
to go to Impel Down.

00:14:25.449 --> 00:14:29.009
So that whole part of the story is now out
of the question.

00:14:29.009 --> 00:14:33.860
Plus, since Rayleigh made a vivre card for
Luffy, let’s assume the Dark King finds

00:14:33.860 --> 00:14:39.870
Luffy and basically forces him to not recklessly
rush into Impel Down.

00:14:39.870 --> 00:14:45.670
And it’s incredibly fortunate for Luffy
that Rayleigh tracks him down, because despite

00:14:45.670 --> 00:14:52.480
their attempts to be sneaky, I feel like someone
strong and with incredible haki like Katakuri

00:14:52.480 --> 00:14:54.820
would probably be able to find them.

00:14:54.820 --> 00:15:00.740
So with the one billion berry Yonko Commander
on their tail, they would need Rayleigh’s

00:15:00.740 --> 00:15:09.310
incredible strength and experience to keep
the donut man from claiming Luffy’s bounty.

00:15:09.310 --> 00:15:15.880
But after they survive that encounter, they
come up with another plan to rescue Ace.

00:15:15.880 --> 00:15:20.560
Because even though it would definitely be
safe for Luffy just to stay out of the Summit

00:15:20.560 --> 00:15:30.680
war, there is absolutely no way Luffy wouldn’t
try to save his brother.

00:15:30.680 --> 00:15:36.670
So after some sneaky transponder snail calls,
the Kuja ship sails towards Marineford.

00:15:36.670 --> 00:15:42.089
And at this point I think the Straw Hats would
all want to regroup with Luffy.

00:15:42.089 --> 00:15:46.709
Unfortunately, they probably wouldn’t make
it in time for the execution because they

00:15:46.709 --> 00:15:54.110
were literally sent all around the world while
Luffy already isn’t too far from Marineford.

00:15:54.110 --> 00:16:01.490
Now let’s dive straight into the marine’s
main base, where the 100 billion berry Luffy

00:16:01.490 --> 00:16:06.019
is going to completely change this legendary
battle.

00:16:06.019 --> 00:16:08.610
They arrive with the fighting already begun.

00:16:08.610 --> 00:16:13.700
The strongest man in the world, Whitebeard,
is here to save his beloved crew mate, Ace,

00:16:13.700 --> 00:16:16.170
before the world government can execute him.

00:16:16.170 --> 00:16:23.050
Luffy jumps into the battle with his allies
at his side.

00:16:23.050 --> 00:16:29.259
And his arrival immediately shifts the attention
of nearly everyone at the battle.

00:16:29.259 --> 00:16:34.590
He is basically one of the most recognizable
pirates in the world at this point, so while

00:16:34.590 --> 00:16:39.160
Whitebeard’s allies are making their push
for Ace, a good chunk of marines, and even

00:16:39.160 --> 00:16:44.139
Warlords like Doflamingo and Mihawk turn their
attention to Luffy.

00:16:44.139 --> 00:16:49.190
What’s even more insane is that the world
government was listening in on all those secret

00:16:49.190 --> 00:16:53.560
messages sent by Rayleigh, so they fully expected
Luffy to show up.

00:16:53.560 --> 00:16:59.120
And here to capture him are these secret agents
– who have been reinstated specifically

00:16:59.120 --> 00:17:00.250
to catch Luffy.

00:17:00.250 --> 00:17:07.459
Also I think even CP0 might be here with the
specific goal of capturing Luffy.

00:17:07.459 --> 00:17:16.060
And remember that this is all before Luffy
has learned haki so these are still incredibly

00:17:16.060 --> 00:17:20.630
difficult opponents for him to face.

00:17:20.630 --> 00:17:25.720
However, none of these masked fighters are
going to have a chance of capturing Luffy

00:17:25.720 --> 00:17:29.230
because of who shows up next.

00:17:29.230 --> 00:17:35.800
That’s because the one Rayleigh was sending
those messages to was none other than Shanks.

00:17:35.800 --> 00:17:39.669
And this time, he’s not late to the party.

00:17:39.669 --> 00:17:45.559
Instead, the strongest pirate crew in the
world is here to support Luffy basically right

00:17:45.559 --> 00:17:53.610
from the start.

00:17:53.610 --> 00:17:59.230
Before we go any further, it is important
to remember Shanks true intentions when he

00:17:59.230 --> 00:18:02.110
came to Marineford in the original story.

00:18:02.110 --> 00:18:07.580
He basically just wanted to stop the bloodshed
and was willing to take on anyone who still

00:18:07.580 --> 00:18:08.580
wanted to fight.

00:18:08.580 --> 00:18:13.460
So it’s not like Shanks would come and basically
win the war to rescue Ace.

00:18:13.460 --> 00:18:16.160
All he is really trying to do is to protect
Luffy.

00:18:16.160 --> 00:18:21.580
But of course, Luffy doesn’t spare much
time for his long awaited reunion, and instead

00:18:21.580 --> 00:18:23.880
goes straight to rescue his brother.

00:18:23.880 --> 00:18:29.510
Though you won’t believe who is tailing
Shanks like a stray cat looking for some love.

00:18:29.510 --> 00:18:33.590
That is if the cat was a giant, fiery dragon,
of course.

00:18:33.590 --> 00:18:40.100
That’s right, because in chapter 533 we
learned that Shanks stopped Kaido from coming

00:18:40.100 --> 00:18:46.000
to Marineford, but if Shanks is here then
might as well roll out the red carpet for

00:18:46.000 --> 00:18:48.770
this battle-hungry beast.

00:18:48.770 --> 00:18:54.200
Which means this truly is becoming an all
out clash between the world’s strongest

00:18:54.200 --> 00:19:00.120
powers with Luffy’s 100 billion berry head
at the center.

00:19:00.120 --> 00:19:03.530
But what is Kaido even doing here in the first
place?

00:19:03.530 --> 00:19:08.100
Well, originally we were told that he wanted
to come to Marineford to kill Whitebeard,

00:19:08.100 --> 00:19:12.710
so he could go after the earthquake man himself,
or he could take advantage of the chaos to

00:19:12.710 --> 00:19:15.760
try to kill Luffy and collect that massive
bounty.

00:19:15.760 --> 00:19:20.539
Although, at this point with all the marines
and government agents here, I’m not sure

00:19:20.539 --> 00:19:25.530
the world government is going to be paying
any bounties to pirates who are literally

00:19:25.530 --> 00:19:27.580
destroying Marine HQ.

00:19:27.580 --> 00:19:34.750
Whatever Kaido’s motivations are, his presence
makes rescuing Ace nearly impossible for Luffy.

00:19:34.750 --> 00:19:38.659
Because surely this would bring Garp and Sengoku
into the battle.

00:19:38.659 --> 00:19:44.049
And if Kaido is targeting Luffy, then Shanks
would surely have his hands full fighting

00:19:44.049 --> 00:19:45.500
the world’s strongest creature.

00:19:45.500 --> 00:19:50.799
And with Shanks occupied, that leaves more
strong opponents who could come after the

00:19:50.799 --> 00:19:58.520
100 Billion berry man, and wow my brain is
racing too fast to even think of all the ways

00:19:58.520 --> 00:20:00.490
this could go.

00:20:00.490 --> 00:20:06.590
One option Mihawk could take on Kaido, since
Mihawk refused to fight against Shanks originally.

00:20:06.590 --> 00:20:12.210
Or another possibility that I can see is Shanks
could eventually convince Kaido to stop going

00:20:12.210 --> 00:20:13.230
after Luffy.

00:20:13.230 --> 00:20:17.890
After all, we know that Kaido has an intense
interest in Joy Boy, so maybe Shanks could

00:20:17.890 --> 00:20:22.299
hint to Kaido that Luffy is destined to become
Joy Boy.

00:20:22.299 --> 00:20:27.549
So if Kaido wants to face the real Joy Boy
in the future, he had better let Luffy live

00:20:27.549 --> 00:20:28.549
for now.

00:20:28.549 --> 00:20:33.850
But even if the oni agreed, that doesn’t
mean Kaido would simply leave.

00:20:33.850 --> 00:20:41.090
He might change his target and go after Whitebeard
or maybe just destroy the entire island with

00:20:41.090 --> 00:20:43.520
his insane elemental powers.

00:20:43.520 --> 00:20:48.880
Because, let’s be honest, he wants to destroy
the world anyway.

00:20:48.880 --> 00:20:54.370
And in all of this insanity, Blackbeard had
really better think hard about joining the

00:20:54.370 --> 00:20:55.370
battle.

00:20:55.370 --> 00:20:59.360
In the original Marineford, he snuck in to
kill Whitebeard while all of the other top-tiers

00:20:59.360 --> 00:21:01.530
were either distracted or weakened.

00:21:01.530 --> 00:21:05.770
But that would not be the case this time,
and he would have a much harder time killing

00:21:05.770 --> 00:21:17.580
Whitebeard to take his fruit, especially because
he didn’t even want to fight Shanks in the

00:21:17.580 --> 00:21:23.919
first place.

00:21:23.919 --> 00:21:29.179
With all of these crazy conflicts, we have
to ask how would it actually end?

00:21:29.179 --> 00:21:35.169
Well, there’s certainly a possibility that
all the chaos and the focus on Luffy will

00:21:35.169 --> 00:21:37.590
allow Whitebeard to free Ace earlier.

00:21:37.590 --> 00:21:43.240
On the other hand, the world government could
just order them to kill Ace right at the start

00:21:43.240 --> 00:21:50.110
and then give all of their attention to capture
Luffy.

00:21:50.110 --> 00:21:54.260
But somehow this battle must end.

00:21:54.260 --> 00:21:57.909
Maybe Ace dies and Shanks or Rayleigh force
Luffy to retreat.

00:21:57.909 --> 00:22:03.529
Or another option is that all of the destructive
powers clashing literally breaks the island,

00:22:03.529 --> 00:22:06.390
and the marine headquarters starts to collapse
into the sea.

00:22:06.390 --> 00:22:08.770
This means everyone is forced to escape.

00:22:08.770 --> 00:22:13.380
So I’d imagine that at the end,&nbsp; Ace would
still have died.

00:22:13.380 --> 00:22:17.790
And probably Whitebeard too, since he had
a heart attack during the original battle.

00:22:17.790 --> 00:22:21.550
Then what happens to our 100 billion berry
man?

00:22:21.550 --> 00:22:27.409
Well, with Ace dead, he would still be at
the lowest point in his entire life.

00:22:27.409 --> 00:22:31.669
However, Shanks and Rayleigh would be there
to guide him to the next steps of his journey.

00:22:31.669 --> 00:22:36.220
Of course Luffy would learn his haki just
like he did during the time skip, but I also

00:22:36.220 --> 00:22:41.909
think Shanks could personally train him to
help him get even stronger.

00:22:41.909 --> 00:22:46.679
The Red Hair Captain might also tell him about
the true nature of his devil fruit – assuming

00:22:46.679 --> 00:22:52.909
of course that Shanks knows this in the first
place.

00:22:52.909 --> 00:22:58.400
These two would have to do this because before
Luffy sets out on the next part of his adventure,

00:22:58.400 --> 00:23:03.440
he would need to be way stronger than he was
entering the New World after the time skip.

00:23:03.440 --> 00:23:09.550
So even if he doesn’t awaken Gear 5, having
some idea about his true powers could help

00:23:09.550 --> 00:23:15.600
it unlock it faster and be better prepared
for all of the strong pirates who will undoubtedly

00:23:15.600 --> 00:23:18.700
come after his insane bounty.

00:23:18.700 --> 00:23:24.620
And when they do enter the new world, the
entire crew better be ready for the challenges

00:23:24.620 --> 00:23:25.620
ahead.

00:23:25.620 --> 00:23:29.450
That means Zoro fans everywhere will probably
get to see more of the green haired swordsman

00:23:29.450 --> 00:23:33.789
truly challenged as the straw hats try to
conquer the New World.

00:23:33.789 --> 00:23:39.120
However, the crew would probably never even
have made it to the grand line without Zoro,

00:23:39.120 --> 00:23:45.710
and if you want to know just how far the crew
would have gotten without him, you can watch

00:23:45.710 --> 00:23:49.770
this video right here.

00:23:49.770 --> 00:23:53.099
Shanks for watching and I’ll see you in
the next one.

